{"id": "swebq0007", "pool": "swebq", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2816790151, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "aa7a8a6f2040793a4fe8dabcb6d10f2520887b0e0988d37809c3a27ef31575d8", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 5, "query": "what country did gregor mendel live in?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/swebq0007.wav", "input_sha256": "de79baebafe044d7e803dd1323ef5bc27fe1c0cd6151034e36dbdc78aa0cc3fa", "input_samples": 32676, "input_s": 2.042, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.1951, "act": 0.9986, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Gregor Mendel lived in Austria — specifically in what is now Brno, Czech Republic, which was then part of the Austrian Empire.", "expert_answer": "Gregor Mendel lived in **Austria** — specifically in what is now **Brno, Czech Republic**, which was then part of the **Austrian Empire**.", "transcript": "What country did Gregor Mendel live in?\n", "asr_s": 0.61, "expert_s": 1.73, "expert_input_samples": 32676, "expert_input_s": 2.042, "expert_input_sha256": "de79baebafe044d7e803dd1323ef5bc27fe1c0cd6151034e36dbdc78aa0cc3fa", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 1.634, "relay_synth_ms": 3874, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 0, "feed_lag_max_ms": 75, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 75, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0007_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "cbb60fd6e72f177f182144d22e12680a54f410807c89151464d2bf94d4889d7f", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 7.56}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0007_always_candidate.wav", "sha256": "c61b812ec1f30577f5f56e3c6f488882d1d9eff575aac680160ba3cf0ed5f568", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0007_always_stall.wav", "sha256": "cf735e2b18e1d7b632bbf48d916593f4cf2be3cabb520f1845eac217cc554828", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.063, 1.114, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.065, 2.117, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.042, 2.179, 2.23, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.042, 3.108, 3.722, 0, 24000, 0]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 2.042, "last_real_feed_done": 2.179, "onset": 3.722, "gate_read_done": 3.723, "fire": 3.723, "candidate_first_pcm": 3.722, "stall_note": 3.723, "stall_first_pcm": 4.428, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 4.428, "expert_req": 3.723, "expert_resp": 6.062, "relay_synth_start": 6.062, "relay_first_pcm": 6.78, "relay_synth_end": 9.936, "first_any_pcm": 3.722, "first_answer_pcm": 6.78, "session_end": 10.057}, "ttfa_answer_s": 4.737, "ttfa_any_s": 1.68}
{"id": "swebq0015", "pool": "swebq", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 1358012138, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "aa7a8a6f2040793a4fe8dabcb6d10f2520887b0e0988d37809c3a27ef31575d8", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 5, "query": "where is the scottish house in skyfall?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/swebq0015.wav", "input_sha256": "87c6d6a42d1d1599945b15271f17f9c1f9f618c02ee684f4e666f5b176f2d835", "input_samples": 31190, "input_s": 1.949, "n_real_chunks": 2, "score": 0.8615, "act": 0.999, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "The Scottish house in Skyfall is Skyfall Lodge, James Bond’s fictional ancestral home. In real life, the exterior scenes were filmed in Glen Etive, in the Scottish Highlands, near Glencoe. The house itself was a temporary set built for the film, not a real lodge you can visit.", "expert_answer": "The Scottish house in *Skyfall* is **Skyfall Lodge**, James Bond’s fictional ancestral home.\n\nIn real life, the exterior scenes were filmed in **Glen Etive**, in the **Scottish Highlands**, near **Glencoe**. The house itself was a temporary set built for the film, not a real lodge you can visit.", "transcript": "Where is the Scottish House in Skyfall?\n", "asr_s": 0.61, "expert_s": 3.93, "expert_input_samples": 31190, "expert_input_s": 1.949, "expert_input_sha256": "87c6d6a42d1d1599945b15271f17f9c1f9f618c02ee684f4e666f5b176f2d835", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 3.838, "relay_synth_ms": 9381, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 0, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0015_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "d1479086a17489bff1cf9f728a25a2199da9bba293d2d5ac355af43e59c239d1", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 19.08}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0015_always_candidate.wav", "sha256": "4a3254f0086959a52d9c0fbd8b652954aa9d1d7622c91fbb1483011e428ef33b", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0015_always_stall.wav", "sha256": "891fa5431b8fae24cbe33f92ca4e73c717be6a19458ff215841f69ffa2cde02a", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.063, 1.117, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 1.949, 2.014, 2.065, 1, 0, 0], [2, 0, 2.949, 3.014, 3.065, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.949, 4.014, 4.652, 0, 24000, 0]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 1.949, "last_real_feed_done": 2.014, "onset": 4.652, "gate_read_done": 4.652, "fire": 4.652, "candidate_first_pcm": 4.652, "stall_note": 4.653, "stall_first_pcm": 5.358, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 5.358, "expert_req": 4.652, "expert_resp": 9.195, "relay_synth_start": 9.196, "relay_first_pcm": 9.911, "relay_synth_end": 18.577, "first_any_pcm": 4.652, "first_answer_pcm": 9.911, "session_end": 18.723}, "ttfa_answer_s": 7.962, "ttfa_any_s": 2.702}
{"id": "swebq0023", "pool": "swebq", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2462017564, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "aa7a8a6f2040793a4fe8dabcb6d10f2520887b0e0988d37809c3a27ef31575d8", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 5, "query": "what type of art leonardo da vinci do?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/swebq0023.wav", "input_sha256": "0e90cbfe2c17c9c1b7272c552a71ce069189f438d6fd73303dcf9d171af13930", "input_samples": 38620, "input_s": 2.414, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.2804, "act": 0.9976, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Leonardo da Vinci made several types of art, especially: Painting — his most famous works include the Mona Lisa and The Last Supper. , Drawing and sketching — he drew anatomy, machines, nature, and scientific ideas. , Sculpture/design — he planned sculptures and monuments, though few were completed. , Architectural and engineering designs — not “art” in the traditional sense, but highly artistic and inventive. He is best known as a Renaissance painter and draftsman.", "expert_answer": "Leonardo da Vinci made several types of art, especially:\n\n- **Painting** — his most famous works include the *Mona Lisa* and *The Last Supper*.\n- **Drawing and sketching** — he drew anatomy, machines, nature, and scientific ideas.\n- **Sculpture/design** — he planned sculptures and monuments, though few were completed.\n- **Architectural and engineering designs** — not “art” in the traditional sense, but highly artistic and inventive.\n\nHe is best known as a **Renaissance painter and draftsman**.", "transcript": "What type of art Leonardo da Vinci do?\n", "asr_s": 0.76, "expert_s": 7.7, "expert_input_samples": 38620, "expert_input_s": 2.414, "expert_input_sha256": "0e90cbfe2c17c9c1b7272c552a71ce069189f438d6fd73303dcf9d171af13930", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 7.77, "relay_synth_ms": 16783, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 0, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0023_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "a962b31fdbf3ad78a044f56bd4336b69e439086e21896fd6461f2eb43c1da78e", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 35.0}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0023_always_candidate.wav", "sha256": "e8d89805b791ef1d3918909bf4c0eedfe14e1035d4bc768c291654ae108fe535", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0023_always_stall.wav", "sha256": "400ac8c5cc5e7c2c5a9874e89fd2b5208946c60bdbd717d5884569e667730fb6", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.063, 1.115, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.065, 2.116, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.414, 2.478, 2.53, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.414, 3.479, 3.857, 0, 24000, 0]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 2.414, "last_real_feed_done": 2.478, "onset": 3.857, "gate_read_done": 3.857, "fire": 3.857, "candidate_first_pcm": 3.857, "stall_note": 3.858, "stall_first_pcm": 4.55, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 4.55, "expert_req": 3.858, "expert_resp": 12.32, "relay_synth_start": 12.32, "relay_first_pcm": 13.036, "relay_synth_end": 29.104, "first_any_pcm": 3.857, "first_answer_pcm": 13.036, "session_end": 29.515}, "ttfa_answer_s": 10.622, "ttfa_any_s": 1.443}
