{"id": "swebq0146", "pool": "swebq", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3041743138, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "aa7a8a6f2040793a4fe8dabcb6d10f2520887b0e0988d37809c3a27ef31575d8", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 5, "query": "what films has daniel craig been in?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/swebq0146.wav", "input_sha256": "14927f83f265e86d2a3ff60e956bc6a92085abeed585f089e9d7c219dafe0a8c", "input_samples": 37877, "input_s": 2.367, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.6965, "act": 0.9984, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Daniel Craig has appeared in many films, including: The Power of One (1992) , A Kid in King Arthur’s Court (1995) , Elizabeth (1998) , Love Is the Devil: Study for a Portrait of Francis Bacon (1998) , The Trench (1999) , Some Voices (2000) , Lara Croft: Tomb Raider (2001) , Road to Perdition (2002) , Sylvia (2003) , The Mother (2003) , Layer Cake (2004) , Enduring Love (2004) , Munich (2005) ,.", "expert_answer": "Daniel Craig has appeared in many films, including:  \n\n- **The Power of One** (1992)  \n- **A Kid in King Arthur’s Court** (1995)  \n- **Elizabeth** (1998)  \n- **Love Is the Devil: Study for a Portrait of Francis Bacon** (1998)  \n- **The Trench** (1999)  \n- **Some Voices** (2000)  \n- **Lara Croft: Tomb Raider** (2001)  \n- **Road to Perdition** (2002)  \n- **Sylvia** (2003)  \n- **The Mother** (2003)  \n- **Layer Cake** (2004)  \n- **Enduring Love** (2004)  \n- **Munich** (2005)  \n- **Infamous** (2006)  \n- **Casino Royale** (2006)  \n- **The Golden Compass** (2007)  \n- **Defiance** (2008)  \n- **Quantum of Solace** (2008)  \n- **Cowboys & Aliens** (2011)  \n- **Dream House** (2011)  \n- **The Adventures of Tintin** (2011)  \n- **The Girl with the Dragon Tattoo** (2011)  \n- **Skyfall** (2012)  \n- **Spectre** (2015)  \n- **Logan Lucky** (2017)  \n- **Kings** (2017)  \n- **Knives Out** (2019)  \n- **No Time to Die** (2021)  \n- **Glass Onion: A Knives Out Mystery** (2022)  \n- **Queer** (2024)  \n- **Wake Up Dead Man** (2025)  \n\nHe is best known for playing **James Bond** in *Casino Royale*, *Quantum of Solace*, *Skyfall*, *Spectre*, and *No Time to Die*, and **Benoit Blanc** in the *Knives Out* films. ([imdb.com](https://www.imdb.com/name/nm0185819/?showAllCredits=true&utm_source=openai))", "transcript": "What films has Daniel Craig been in?\n", "asr_s": 0.65, "expert_s": 8.69, "expert_input_samples": 37877, "expert_input_s": 2.367, "expert_input_sha256": "14927f83f265e86d2a3ff60e956bc6a92085abeed585f089e9d7c219dafe0a8c", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 7.901, "relay_synth_ms": 21977, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 1, "feed_lag_max_ms": 297, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 297, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0146_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "723d7fe0958fbd0ed6602a6d16a7efb477b4cff20bd916e5334fe60c7277a62f", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 44.28}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0146_always_candidate.wav", "sha256": "c39251a3b82725643e977ab4a813ea1db6999b9242df2f43cefcc3e6a64f4244", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0146_always_stall.wav", "sha256": "b9eae14f3b4063c5bac09e26c3610d1e49a103c485481fd3004c27506a500ccb", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 2.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.062, 1.112, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.063, 2.113, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.367, 2.43, 2.481, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.367, 3.432, 4.028, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.367, 4.732, 5.469, 0, 30720, 1]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 2.367, "last_real_feed_done": 2.43, "onset": 4.028, "gate_read_done": 4.028, "fire": 4.028, "candidate_first_pcm": 4.028, "stall_note": 4.029, "stall_first_pcm": 4.664, "local_first_pcm": null, "w