 \n\nThere were also **rumored flings** with **Paris Hilton** and **Haylie Duff**. ([glamour.com](https://www.glamour.com/story/brody-jenner-ex-girlfriends))", "transcript": "What celebrities has Brody Jenner dated?\n", "asr_s": 0.59, "expert_s": 14.31, "expert_input_samples": 42335, "expert_input_s": 2.646, "expert_input_sha256": "7ea1d4e9c8aa4f1d8670234d52f09534dc2f5aedaca3e44b4b7ffe87bdee9a11", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 14.351, "relay_synth_ms": 16803, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 0, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0198_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "7aa99b90991dd35c840231f91ae358da3256354d56b9a4c8677f1da13726f0e3", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 33.32}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0198_always_candidate.wav", "sha256": "b8d6fa2d64c98fbf435d1d3f3d928cd890c1f06e01fb5f18edce063276ddc415", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0198_always_stall.wav", "sha256": "b45c026f78d74aa304f540615cb227aaeb76ffddafa821c6bae039d16c895026", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.24}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.062, 1.112, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.064, 2.114, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.646, 2.711, 2.762, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.646, 3.71, 4.3, 0, 24000, 0]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 2.646, "last_real_feed_done": 2.711, "onset": 4.3, "gate_read_done": 4.3, "fire": 4.3, "candidate_first_pcm": 4.3, "stall_note": 4.301, "stall_first_pcm": 4.844, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 4.844, "expert_req": 4.301, "expert_resp": 19.195, "relay_synth_start": 19.195, "relay_first_pcm": 19.909, "relay_synth_end": 35.999, "first_any_pcm": 4.3, "first_answer_pcm": 19.909, "session_end": 36.979}, "ttfa_answer_s": 17.263, "ttfa_any_s": 1.654}
{"id": "swebq0208", "pool": "swebq", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 887031672, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "aa7a8a6f2040793a4fe8dabcb6d10f2520887b0e0988d37809c3a27ef31575d8", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 5, "query": "what kind of guitar did george harrison use?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/swebq0208.wav", "input_sha256": "b8838eb4e6964218aef82924b8480e6d57099f7c34e97ff91c05fb7236787ae9", "input_samples": 38620, "input_s": 2.414, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.6582, "act": 0.9993, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "George Harrison used many guitars, but some of his most famous were: Gretsch Country Gentleman – heavily used with The Beatles in the early 1960s. , Rickenbacker 360/12 – a 12-string electric heard on songs like A Hard Day’s Night. , Epiphone Casino – used in the mid-to-late Beatles period. , Fender Stratocaster “Rocky” – his psychedelic-painted Strat used around Sgt. If you mean his most iconic Beatles-era guitar, it’s probably the Gretsch Country Gentleman or the Rickenbacker 360/12.", "expert_answer": "George Harrison used **many guitars**, but some of his most famous were:\n\n- **Gretsch Country Gentleman** – heavily used with The Beatles in the early 1960s.\n- **Rickenbacker 360/12** – a 12-string electric heard on songs like *A Hard Day’s Night*.\n- **Epiphone Casino** – used in the mid-to-late Beatles period.\n- **Fender Stratocaster “Rocky”** – his psychedelic-painted Strat used around *Sgt. Pepper* and later.\n- **Gibson Les Paul “Lucy”** – a red Les Paul given to him by Eric Clapton.\n- **Fender Rosewood Telecaster** – used during the *Let It Be* sessions and the rooftop concert.\n\nIf you mean his **most iconic Beatles-era guitar**, it’s probably the **Gretsch Country Gentleman** or the **Rickenbacker 360/12**.", "transcript": "What kind of guitar did George Harrison use?\n", "asr_s": 0.54, "expert_s": 5.55, "expert_input_samples": 38620, "expert_input_s": 2.414, "expert_input_sha256": "b8838eb4e6964218aef82924b8480e6d57099f7c34e97ff91c05fb7236787ae9", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 5.399, "relay_synth_ms": 15771, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 0, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0208_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "3d64a88b07a226f07ad2c1191a9eec3b882839b65d51cd278fa1a0ba8f5ddbff", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 30.48}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0208_always_candidate.wav", "sha256": "f3358f6c938323a394e504d6a615625b496f19720c3f32ecb203e15dfdcadf1d", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0208_always_stall.wav", "sha256": "4a0f2b1554c102639f1d9f3520e6cf4325c6757b065fe0ceb49711e3cf480e57", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.062, 1.113, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.064, 2.114, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.414, 2.477, 2.527, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.414, 3.478, 3.882, 0, 24000, 0]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 2.414, "last_real_feed_done": 2.477, "onset": 3.882, "gate_read_done": 3.882, "fire": 3.882, "candidate_first_pcm": 3.882, "stall_note": 3.883, "stall_first_pcm": 4.577, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 4.577, "expert_req": 3.883, "expert_resp": 9.976, "relay_synth_start": 9.976, "relay_first_pcm": 10.698, "relay_synth_end": 25.748, "first_any_pcm": 3.882, "first_answer_pcm": 10.698, "session_end": 26.087}, "ttfa_answer_s": 8.284, "ttfa_any_s": 1.468}
